0 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/963a9fb523b4dd675b72f9fe29f5b66a.webm?t=1759172084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/extras/963a9fb523b4dd675b72f9fe29f5b66a.mp4?t=1759172084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy, chaotic combat \u2013 Deckbuilding meets explosive RPG auto-battles. Enemies burn, freeze, shatter, and melt as you and your summons tear through corrupted monstrosities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep custom character builds \u2013 Become a lone tank, a swarm-summoning shaman, or something in between. Build around cards, gear, and passives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ hand drawn items \u2013 Every item is unique and visually appears on your character in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive world map \u2013 Choose your path through story nodes, conquer quests, face grotesque bosses, and push toward the Lighthouse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord, so you can play earlier versions and give us feedback and suggestions! The link's on the right sidebar</p>","developers":["OneShark"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907920/b6c6b3ef9e68166eb12fd9ebe090631614526127/header.jpg?t=1759172084","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme